{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your city and protect it from the enemy takeover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total of 24 types of ground and air units are ready to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle them across four distinct biomes spanning over 30 levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from seven towers, each with four upgrade levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place them strategically along enemy routes for maximum damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect enough money to upgrade towers in the field and unlock new towers and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge and earn the gold medal in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did you spot the flamingo?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has been carefully optimized and should run smoothly even on lower-end hardware such as laptops, netbooks, or tablets. Battery life on mobile devices should also benefit, making <i>City Defense</i> the perfect game for on the go. Steam must be running, but an internet connection is not required to play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828800?t=1751889804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828800?t=1751889804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828800/f231189a78eceb6d2056b531932846b0dbc9d71a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751889804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828800/f231189a78eceb6d2056b531932846b0dbc9d71a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751889804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Tower defense game featuring gun turrets, rocket launchers, flamethrowers, and tesla coils to eliminate stylised enemy targets. No depiction of blood, dismemberment, or similar violent content."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your city and protect it from the enemy takeover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total of 24 types of ground and air units are ready to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle them across four distinct biomes spanning over 30 levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from seven towers, each with four upgrade levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place them strategically along enemy routes for maximum damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect enough money to upgrade towers in the field and unlock new towers and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the challenge and earn the gold medal in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did you spot the flamingo?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has been carefully optimized and should run smoothly even on lower-end hardware such as laptops, netbooks, or tablets. Battery life on mobile devices should also benefit, making <i>City Defense</i> the perfect game for on the go. Steam must be running, but an internet connection is not required to play.</p>","developers":["Earflap Hat Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828